# Issue tracking — Jira

Provider config lives in `docs/config/issue-tracking.yaml`. Required env:

- `ATLASSIAN_SITE_URL`
- `ATLASSIAN_USER_EMAIL`
- `ATLASSIAN_API_TOKEN`

## Operations

<!-- Harness scaffold: integration=jira -->

- Create issue → `mcp__atlassian__create_issue` with project key from config.
- Update status → `mcp__atlassian__transition_issue`.
- Comment → `mcp__atlassian__add_comment`.
- Link → `mcp__atlassian__create_issue_link` (use `Blocks`, `Relates`, `Implements`).

